<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
  <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
Hello {{recipient}},
<br><br>
Your <a href="https://app.fiatx.co/liquidity/{{provider}}">liquidity</a> has
received a swap request.
{{amount}} {{base}} of your liquidity has been ordered for {{cost}} {{quote}}.
<br><br>
Go to the <a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">order</a> page to
{{#if isBaseLocal}}send off-chain payment using the
payment method supplied by the counterparty and mark the order as
`PAID` after completing payment{{else}}release the asset only after
confirming off-line payment to your listed payment method{{/if}}.
<br><br>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">View Order</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/liquidity/{{provider}}">View Liquidity</a>
  </li>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/market/{{marketAddress}}">View Market</a></li>
</ul>
<br>
<b>WARNING</b>
<ul style="color: indianred">
  {{#if isBaseLocal}}
    <li><i style="color: indianred">Ensure you are sending payment to the
      exact payment details listed by the on-chain asset owner or counterparty
      .</i></li>
  {{else}}
    <li><i style="color: indianred">Never release your asset until you have
      verified that your have received the exact payment amount. <b>You may
        lose your asset if you release it before confirming payment. FIATX will
        not be able to help you recover it.</b>
    </i></li>
  {{/if}}
</ul>
<br>
{{app}}
</body>
</html>
